  "explain_en": "Wrong answer: 「工期をもっと早くするには、原価がもっと低くなる」— Wrong because if you make it faster, costs usually INCREASE (need more labor, overtime shifts), not decrease.\n\nVocabulary:\n原価（げんか）: Cost / Cost price\n工期（こうき）: Construction period\n品質（ひんしつ）: Quality\n関係（かんけい）: Relationship\n高（たか）くなる: To increase / To become higher\n低（ひく）くなる: To decrease / To become lower\n早（はや）くする: To make faster / To shorten\n遅（おそ）くする: To make slower / To extend",
